### Variables - usa la misma URL que .env (URL_QA)
@token = mqAMM5yzX78tnrolcyHytYI1wT6uYTk1u5rVSeB6
@baseUrl = https://api.eterniasoft.com/v3

### Canales de entrada
GET {{baseUrl}}/input_channels
Authorization: {{token}}

### Medios de captación
GET {{baseUrl}}/captation_ways
Authorization: {{token}}

### Proyectos
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: {{token}}

### Usuarios (vendedores) - usar un id para SPERANT_AGENT_ID si falla asignación
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: {{token}}

### Crear cliente (POST) - Ejecuta después de obtener input_channel_id y source_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fname": "Juan",
  "lname": "Pérez Test",
  "email": "test@ejemplo.com",
  "phone": "+51 999 888 777",
  "input_channel_id": 1,
  "source_id": 1,
  "interest_type_id": 4
}
